'''Floor 20''' is the 20th floor of [[Heavenly Tower]].

As of [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]], clearing this floor allows the player to begin Heavenly Tower at [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 11|Floor 11]] on subsequent appearences.
